WEBVTT

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:05.030
Eh? Hiyama?

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:07.360
Why are you here!?

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.020
What, so I can't be here?

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:10.380
This is my house.

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:13.810
Huh? Your family runs a bathhouse?

00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:15.750
And why are you here, Aoi?

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:17.860
Our bath is broken.

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:19.120
Oh, I see.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.660
So he helps his family out...

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:22.790
Hiyama may be a good kid.

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:26.230
What are you looking at? Eww...

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:30.690
Huh? Look who's talking! You better not peek!

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:33.750
Who's gonna look at you? Just go in already.

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:35.110
Hmph!

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:40.460
He makes me mad.

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:43.360
Aoi Yui, age 12.

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:46.000
No matter how much I want to fall in love,

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.340
it won't be with any of the boys in my class, that's for sure.

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:53.150
Why does Hiyama always tease me so much?

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:55.120
He's so childish.

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:57.690
What is this?

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.370
A guestbook?

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:02.040
People wrote their thoughts.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:03.650
And there are responses.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:05.520
I should write something.

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:07.550
I'm going in here!

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:08.890
I told you to stop!

00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:11.460
Yeah! I'm number one!

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:12.790
Stop right there!

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:28.260
I want to die...

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:16.700
Yui...

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:20.700
Well, Hiyama didn't do that on purpose.

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:26.070
Good morning.

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:28.620
Takao! Good morning.

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:30.750
First period is Japanese, right?

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:32.990
Y-Yeah, I think.

00:03:32.990 --> 00:03:34.470
You think?

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:38.600
Hey, look over here.

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:46.150
There we ago! A new quote!

00:03:46.150 --> 00:03:47.210
Quote?

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:53.000
We are gathering Sir Takao's quotes!

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.530
This is part of the boyfriend-girlfriend quotes!

00:03:58.450 --> 00:04:00.130
The boys are such idiots.

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:01.250
Yeah.

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:06.020
Hey, Hiyama was so cool during the relay today.

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:09.320
Hiyama is so handsome and athletic!

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:11.210
He's so nice!

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:12.500
Oh, really?

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:16.170
You have the air of an honor student, Yui.

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:19.460
But when it comes to Hiyama, you become quite strict.

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:22.010
That's because Hiyama keeps getting on my nerves.

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:26.760
It seems like boys like to tease the ones they like the most.

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:28.270
That's what my older sister said.

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:31.240
Huh? Hiyama likes me?

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:32.510
That's impossible.

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:34.330
Really?

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:37.320
Hiyama should have apologized properly.

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:40.430
Being seen naked is so embarrassing!

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:43.470
Yui, you're wearing a bra already?

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:45.290
Huh? Yeah...

00:04:45.290 --> 00:04:46.740
How mature!

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:48.000
How about you, Marin?

00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:50.550
I only wear sports bras.

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:54.060
But there are a lot more girls wearing bras.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.160
Eh?

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:58.240
Hanabi, you're still wearing an undershirt?

00:04:58.240 --> 00:05:03.480
Takao's going to break up with you soon if you keep wearing such childish underwear.

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:10.610
I never thought of my underwear as childish!

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:13.880
Okay! Let's go choose a cute bra for you!

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:16.260
Really? Thank you so much!

00:05:16.260 --> 00:05:17.990
Come too, Yui!

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:19.820
I'll pass...

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:23.140
Your bra is a bit off.

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:24.610
It's a bit small.

00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:32.840
Wow! There are so many!

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:36.390
This is pretty cute!

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:38.590
It smells pretty nice, too!

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:42.300
Bring out that bust...

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:44.970
I don't really like bras.

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:47.120
They hurt and are very tight.

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:49.180
Want me to take your measurements?

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:51.090
I'm fine...

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:54.060
You wear bras everyday.

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:58.460
It's not good for your body if you buy the wrong size.

00:05:58.460 --> 00:05:59.860
Really?

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:02.800
Want to try on some bras?

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:05.420
Let me take your measurements.

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:08.390
The size of your bra is key.

00:06:08.390 --> 00:06:11.900
No, no, that's a bit embarrassing...

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:15.030
One girl to the fitting room!

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:18.630
Hanabi, I'm sorry I couldn't save you!

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:19.960
I will pray for you!

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:21.670
Let me take your measurements.

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:25.970
Déjà vu!?

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:28.750
Yui, I'm sorry.

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:31.740
When they took me aside, that really scared me!

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.140
Me too.

00:06:33.140 --> 00:06:36.320
I even bought a rabbit panda bra!

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:39.780
Yui's simple white bra is cute, too!

00:06:39.780 --> 00:06:43.760
Wearing the right sized bra doesn't hurt at all.

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:48.060
I feel like I'm becoming a lady!

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:49.410
You're right.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:59.980
I feel like I'm a bit taller, too.

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:03.020
Aoi, do you have a minute?

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:04.470
Yeah...

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:09.240
He's from the class next door.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:11.220
Mori, I think?

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:18.910
Please think about it.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:24.270
Yui! You're amazing!

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:26.460
That was a confession, right!?

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:28.990
A con-fess-ion!

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:33.430
That's the first time someone confessed to me.

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:35.510
"Please think about it."

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:38.660
"I'm in shock! This is so sudden!"

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:42.190
"I like you even when you're in shock."

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:44.530
Stop making things up!

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:49.810
Yui will finally have a boyfriend!

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:52.150
Okay? Will you say yes?

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:54.370
Well, I'm not sure yet.

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:58.460
Mori got 20 chocolates during Valentine's Day!

00:07:58.460 --> 00:07:59.700
That's nice!

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.700
Why don't you just try going out with him?

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:02.930
Just try?

00:08:02.930 --> 00:08:07.840
My sis told me that you may start liking him after you go out!

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:12.350
So I can fall in love after going out with him?

00:08:17.190 --> 00:08:20.460
Hey, Hanabi, what does love feel like?

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:22.140
Um...

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:26.190
It's hard to describe...

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:27.850
Even though you have a boyfriend?

00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:32.310
Yeah... I feel like whenever Takao looks at me...

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:35.110
...my chest tightens up, and it hurts...

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:37.360
I can't really talk afterwards...

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:40.870
You can't talk?

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:44.370
Like something is stuck inside my heart...

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:47.040
I really can't describe it!

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:49.140
Eikou! Stop it!

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:50.920
Jeez!

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:52.790
What is he doing?

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:54.030
Touching her arm?

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:57.410
Haven't the boys started touching the girls inappropriately?

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:03.700
Hiyama! What are you making the boys do now?

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:05.480
Why always me?

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:07.470
Stop touching our arms!

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:08.920
I'm not!

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:12.160
I don't have any interest in you, Aoi!

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:16.700
That's what you call being too self-centered!

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:18.920
You know a lot!

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:22.780
What is it?

00:09:22.780 --> 00:09:23.970
There's someone!

00:09:24.670 --> 00:09:27.500
Someone who is interested in me!

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.900
What are you talking about?

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:33.510
Someone confessed to me!

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:35.470
Really!?

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:37.220
Who? Who is it?

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:39.580
None of your business!

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:40.490
What a scrooge!

00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:41.710
So selfish!

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:50.010
Your bathroom isn't fixed yet?

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:57.650
Hiyama is so mean. He always says things that make me mad.

00:09:57.650 --> 00:09:59.500
He's not kind at all.

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:02.300
I really hate him!

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:13.360
Someone responded to me...

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:17.050
Someone here is cheering me on.

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:21.170
Such bad handwriting!

00:10:21.170 --> 00:10:23.670
Is this from Hiyama?

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:26.920
I don't really know who it is,

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:29.040
but I feel much better.

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:32.690
Hiyama!

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:34.580
Have you seen a key?

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:36.830
Key? No...

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:39.680
I see...

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:41.410
Thank you.

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:48.050
Hey! What's this about a key?

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:53.730
Is it something important?

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:59.360
It's from my mother... A key she used...

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:00.600
Wait right here.

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:15.140
Hiyama.

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:22.060
Hiyama, that's enough! Forget about it!

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:23.630
It's something important, right!?

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:29.450
Just wait right there!

00:12:11.220 --> 00:12:12.990
Where was it?

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:15.870
It was stuck near the drain.

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:19.510
Thank you... Thank you... Thank you!

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:20.540
It's fine.

00:12:24.170 --> 00:12:25.520
Thank goodness.

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:31.390
I wanted to thank him more...

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:34.760
But it's like something's stuck.

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:39.410
Is this love?

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:51.680
Aoi.

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:53.320
Mori...

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:56.380
I'm sorry!

00:12:57.010 --> 00:12:59.980
I can't go out with you!

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:01.010
I see...

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:04.540
I haven't really talked with the class next door.

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:07.430
I'm really happy you confessed to me.

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:11.310
But I have someone I like!

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:12.670
So that's why...

00:13:13.860 --> 00:13:14.490
Mori?

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:15.730
Later.

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:19.710
What was that all about?

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:23.090
Yui has someone she likes?

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:24.380
I didn't know.

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:26.230
Who is it!?

00:13:26.810 --> 00:13:29.290
Why were you two eavesdropping again!?

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:31.040
Forget about that!

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:33.640
Who is it!? Who is it!? Who is it!?

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:38.360
We can't wait!

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:39.620
Um...

00:13:39.620 --> 00:13:40.670
Uh...

00:13:41.260 --> 00:13:44.300
It's... Hiyama.

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:53.300
Jeez, Yui.

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:54.860
Hiyama?

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:59.470
Hey, stop that.

00:14:00.850 --> 00:14:03.070
That's great, Yui.

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:05.430
It's just like what you said.

00:14:05.430 --> 00:14:10.150
Love feels like something tightening in your chest.

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:13.730
A maiden in love is such a great sight!

00:14:13.730 --> 00:14:16.900
You should work hard during the next home economics class!

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:18.400
Why?

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:20.110
My sis told me.

00:14:20.110 --> 00:14:23.310
When you confess to somebody using the crepes you make during home economics class,

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:25.040
things will turn out well!

00:14:25.040 --> 00:14:26.070
Really?

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:28.330
"I love you!"

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:29.150
Love...

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:32.730
I've decided who to give mine to!

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:33.990
Me too!

00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:36.700
I am definitely giving mine to Takao!

00:14:40.490 --> 00:14:42.310
A confession, huh?

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:43.930
You're deep in thought!

00:14:43.930 --> 00:14:47.340
Because I want to give my crepe to the person I love, too!

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:49.400
Yui!

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:52.180
What crepe should I make?

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:54.070
I guess strawberry?

00:14:57.020 --> 00:14:58.440
Mori!?

00:14:58.440 --> 00:14:59.560
What should I do?

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:01.600
Should I pass by now?

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:05.830
But maybe he doesn't want to see me...

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:08.890
But if I turn around and walk away...

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:12.750
Aoi, what's wrong?

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:14.640
Hiyama!

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:16.320
Why are you standing there?

00:15:16.320 --> 00:15:19.530
Because Mori's there, and it's hard for me to walk past him.

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:20.460
Huh?

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:21.470
Let's go.

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:24.410
Just hide behind me.

00:15:24.410 --> 00:15:25.810
I'll stay in front.

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:31.560
Even if you want me to hide behind you...

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:35.020
You are shorter than me...

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:38.020
I'm not really hidden.

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:39.890
But...

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:49.140
Please take the ingredients from the front podium.

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:51.850
The bowls are on the shelf behind you.

00:15:52.230 --> 00:15:54.520
I hope they turn out delicious.

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:55.130
Yep!

00:15:57.910 --> 00:15:59.220
What?

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:00.410
Nothing!

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:02.140
Grabbing my arm again?

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:03.490
Oh yeah...

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:05.390
Mori did that too.

00:16:05.390 --> 00:16:07.800
What's that all about?

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:10.410
Who knows? I wonder what it is...

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:17.570
Don't be lazy, Hiyama.

00:16:17.570 --> 00:16:19.320
I'm resting now.

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:21.380
You've been resting this entire time.

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:27.410
Will you be giving yours to that person you said you liked?

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:31.190
Of course...

00:16:35.310 --> 00:16:39.280
Hey, Hiyama, Shino said she's giving her crepe to you.

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:40.990
So after school, can you...

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:41.880
I don't want it.

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:42.460
Huh?

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:47.910
I won't be happy at all if you give it to me.

00:16:48.280 --> 00:16:49.890
Just give it to someone else.

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:52.090
What are you saying?

00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:57.420
They are working hard to see you smile and be thankful!

00:16:57.420 --> 00:17:00.270
They are making their crepes because they want to give them to you!

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:03.660
You didn't have to go so far.

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:08.200
Eh? So the person you're giving yours to is some sort of kind prince?

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:11.000
That's great. I'm not him.

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:12.870
You can't even say a simple thank you?

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:17.010
Why should I!? I'm not interested in their crepes!

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:19.370
Should I just throw them away!?

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:21.400
That's not what I meant!

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:25.170
Do you know how much courage it takes to give your crepe to someone you like?

00:17:25.170 --> 00:17:27.110
What do you understand!?

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:28.510
I do!

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:31.200
Of course I do...

00:17:33.140 --> 00:17:34.100
How pointless.

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:39.000
Why...

00:17:39.640 --> 00:17:41.830
Why has things turned out like this?

00:17:42.110 --> 00:17:43.560
A fight!

00:17:46.340 --> 00:17:48.610
Why did you two fight!?

00:17:48.610 --> 00:17:49.780
Hiyama!

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:51.390
Mori!

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:55.460
Hiyama and Mori?

00:17:56.190 --> 00:17:59.180
I heard you threw the first punch, Hiyama.

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:00.790
Why did you hit him!?

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:05.610
He makes me mad.

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:08.430
Come with me to the staff office, you two!

00:18:08.430 --> 00:18:10.510
Hiyama is so scary!

00:18:10.510 --> 00:18:13.620
He's taking out his anger from being scolded by Yui.

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:16.500
So he's hitting someone out of anger?

00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:18.320
No...

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:24.280
Hiyama wouldn't hurt someone for no reason.

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:27.510
I'm sure he wouldn't.

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:33.840
Does anyone know why Hiyama fought with Mori?

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:37.680
If you know, then please tell me!

00:18:39.690 --> 00:18:45.480
Um, the boys have been touching our arms lately, right?

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:46.300
Yeah.

00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:47.630
She's right.

00:18:47.630 --> 00:18:48.470
Yeah.

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:56.240
That's because the boys said the arm is as soft as your b-breasts...

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:00.260
The boys are the worst!

